#: ../faq/index.rst:5
msgid "Frequently Asked Question (FAQ)"
msgstr "Pogosto zastavljena vprašanja (FAQ)"

#: ../faq/index.rst:9
msgid "What if Galette does not work?"
msgstr "Kaj pa, če Galette ne deluje?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:11
msgid ""
"Sometimes, after an update, a change on hosting, or a simple bug - even "
"minor ones - may cause a fail in Galette. You may observe:"
msgstr ""
"Včasih lahko po posodobitvi sprememba gostovanja ali preprosta napaka – tudi "
"manjša – povzroči napako v Galette. Opazili boste lahko:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:13
msgid "an error message is displayed,"
msgstr "prikaže se sporočilo o napaki,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:14
msgid "a blank page,"
msgstr "prazna stran,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:15 ../faq/index.rst:140
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#: ../faq/index.rst:17
msgid ""
"In all cases, you **must check the logs**. Most of errors are stored in "
"those files, it is a very good start point to understand the problem and "
"potentially solve it."
msgstr ""
"V vseh primerih morate **preveriti dnevnike**. Večina napak je shranjenih v "
"teh datotekah, kar je zelo dobro izhodišče za razumevanje težave in njeno "
"morebitno rešitev."

#: ../faq/index.rst:19
msgid "Galette logs are stored in the ``galette/data/log`` per default."
msgstr "Dnevniki Galette so privzeto shranjeni v mapi ``galette/data/log``."

#: ../faq/index.rst:21
msgid ""
":ref:`Enabling development mode <galettemodes>` will give you more "
"information, and deactivate cache, that may help resolving your issue."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Omogočanje razvojnega načina <galettemodes>` vam bo dalo več "
"informacij in deaktiviralo predpomnilnik, kar vam lahko pomaga rešiti težavo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:27
msgid "My two-factor authentication codes are refused"
msgstr "Moje dvostopenjske kode za preverjanje pristnosti so zavrnjene"

#: ../faq/index.rst:31
msgid ""
"**Check the clocks first.** Codes are computed from the current time, and "
"nothing else. If the clock of your server or the clock of your device is off "
"by more than about a minute, every code is refused, and everything else "
"looks perfectly normal. This is, by a wide margin, the first thing to look "
"at."
msgstr ""
"**Najprej preverite ure.** Kode so izračunane iz trenutnega časa in nič "
"drugega. Če je ura vašega strežnika ali ura vaše naprave pomaknjena za več "
"kot približno minuto, je vsaka koda zavrnjena, vse ostalo pa je videti "
"popolnoma normalno. To je v veliki meri prva stvar, ki jo je treba pogledati."

#: ../faq/index.rst:33
msgid ""
"Galette accepts the code of the current thirty seconds period and of the one "
"just before and just after, which leaves a bit less than a minute and a half "
"of tolerance. Beyond that, set both clocks right -- on the server, by "
"enabling NTP; on a phone, by turning automatic date and time on -- and try "
"again. Most authenticator applications also offer to correct their own clock "
"for you."
msgstr ""
"Galette sprejme kodo trenutnega tridesetsekundnega obdobja ter tistega tik "
"pred in tik za tem, kar pušča nekaj manj kot minuto in pol tolerance. Poleg "
"tega pravilno nastavite obe uri -- na strežniku, tako da omogočite NTP; na "
"telefonu, tako da vklopite samodejni datum in čas -- in poskusite znova. "
"Večina aplikacij za preverjanje pristnosti ponuja tudi popravljanje svoje "
"ure namesto vas."

#: ../faq/index.rst:35
msgid "Two other cases look like a refusal but are not one:"
msgstr "Dva druga primera izgledata kot zavrnitev, vendar nista eno:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:37
msgid ""
"**the same code twice**: a code is accepted once only, so submitting the "
"code you just used to enrol, or reloading the page after a successful login, "
"is refused. Wait for the next one -- it comes at most thirty seconds later."
msgstr ""
"**dvakrat ista koda**: koda je sprejeta samo enkrat, zato je pošiljanje "
"kode, ki ste jo pravkar uporabili za vpis, ali ponovno nalaganje strani po "
"uspešni prijavi zavrnjeno. Počakajte na naslednjega -- pride največ trideset "
"sekund kasneje."

#: ../faq/index.rst:38
msgid ""
"**too many attempts**: after a series of wrong codes, Galette stops "
"answering for a while. Wait it out rather than trying harder."
msgstr ""
"**preveč poskusov**: po seriji napačnih kod se Galette za nekaj časa neha "
"javljati. Raje počakajte, kot da se bolj trudite."

#: ../faq/index.rst:41
msgid "The server clock went backwards"
msgstr "Ura strežnika je šla nazaj"

#: ../faq/index.rst:43
msgid ""
"Galette remembers the last period it accepted a code for, so that a code "
"cannot be used twice. If the clock of the **server** moves backwards -- a "
"virtual machine restored from a snapshot, a large NTP correction, a host "
"without NTP at all -- every code then falls in a period that has already "
"been used, and is refused as such until the clock catches up with what was "
"recorded."
msgstr ""
"Galette si zapomni zadnje obdobje, za katerega je sprejela kodo, tako da "
"kode ni mogoče uporabiti dvakrat. Če se ura **strežnika** premakne nazaj -- "
"virtualni stroj, obnovljen iz posnetka, velik popravek NTP, gostitelj sploh "
"brez NTP -- potem vsaka koda pade v obdobje, ki je že bilo uporabljeno, in "
"je kot taka zavrnjena, dokler ura ne dohiti zapisanega."

#: ../faq/index.rst:45
msgid "Set the server clock right first. Then, for the account concerned:"
msgstr "Najprej pravilno nastavite uro strežnika. Nato za zadevni račun:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:51
msgid "and, for the super administrator:"
msgstr "in za superskrbnika:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:58
msgid "I lost the device computing my codes"
msgstr "Izgubil sem napravo, ki izračunava moje kode"

#: ../faq/index.rst:60
msgid ""
"Use one of the ten recovery codes you were given when you enabled it: the "
"field that asks for a code takes them too. Each one works once. Once logged "
"in, disable the second factor and enable it again on your new device -- and "
"keep the new recovery codes."
msgstr ""
"Uporabite eno od desetih obnovitvenih kod, ki ste jih dobili, ko ste jo "
"omogočili: polje, ki zahteva kodo, jih tudi sprejme. Vsak deluje enkrat. Ko "
"se prijavite, onemogočite drugi faktor in ga znova omogočite v svoji novi "
"napravi - ter obdržite nove obnovitvene kode."

#: ../faq/index.rst:62
msgid ""
"If you have no recovery code left either, ask an administrator or a staff "
"member of your association to :ref:`reset your second factor "
"<member_2fa_reset>`."
msgstr ""
"Če nimate več nobene obnovitvene kode, prosite skrbnika ali člana osebja "
"vašega združenja, da :ref:`ponastavi vaš drugi faktor <member_2fa_reset>`."

#: ../faq/index.rst:65
msgid "The super administrator cannot log in anymore"
msgstr "Superskrbnik se ne more več prijaviti"

#: ../faq/index.rst:67
msgid ""
"That account is not a member, so nobody can reset it from the interface, and "
"it has no recovery codes. Its second factor lives in the preferences, in "
"database, which is where you clear it from:"
msgstr ""
"Ta račun ni član, zato ga nihče ne more ponastaviti iz vmesnika in nima "
"obnovitvenih kod. Njegov drugi dejavnik je v nastavitvah, v bazi podatkov, "
"od koder ga počistite:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:74
msgid ""
"Replace ``galette_`` with your own table prefix if you changed it (the "
"``PREFIX_DB`` setting of your configuration file). The next login asks for "
"the password alone."
msgstr ""
"Zamenjajte ``galette_`` s svojo lastno predpono tabele, če ste jo spremenili "
"(nastavitev ``PREFIX_DB`` vaše konfiguracijske datoteke). Naslednja prijava "
"zahteva samo geslo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:76
msgid ""
"To turn the second factor off for the whole instance at the same time -- the "
"way out when something goes wrong for everybody at once -- add:"
msgstr ""
"Če želite izklopiti drugi dejavnik za celoten primer hkrati - izhod, ko gre "
"nekaj narobe za vse hkrati - dodajte:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:82
msgid ""
"Members who had enabled one keep it; they are simply no longer asked for a "
"code until a policy is set again."
msgstr ""
"Člani, ki so ga omogočili, ga obdržijo; od njih se preprosto ne zahteva več "
"kode, dokler pravilnik ni ponovno nastavljen."

#: ../faq/index.rst:86
msgid ""
"Keep an access to your database at hand before you enable a second factor on "
"the super administrator account. It is the only way back in for it."
msgstr ""
"Imejte pri roki dostop do svoje zbirke podatkov, preden omogočite drugi "
"faktor v računu super skrbnika. To je edina pot nazaj."

#: ../faq/index.rst:90
msgid "How to report a bug or ask for a feature?"
msgstr "Kako prijaviti napako ali zahtevati funkcijo?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:92
msgid ""
"Bugs reports as well as RFE (Request For Enhancement) must be done on the "
"`Galette tracker <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette>`_, for Galette "
"itself, all official plugins and also documentation."
msgstr ""
"Poročila o napakah in RFE (Zahteva za izboljšavo) je treba narediti na "
"`Sledilniku Galette <https://bugs.galette.eu/projects/galette>`_, za samo "
"Galette, vse uradne vtičnike in tudi dokumentacijo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:96
msgid ""
"Unless you are sure you know, please do not attribute the ticket and do not "
"set target version. It will be done when it is taken into account."
msgstr ""
"Če niste prepričani, da veste, prosimo, da ne navajate avtorja zahteve in ne "
"nastavljate ciljne različice. To bo storjeno, ko bo upoštevana."

#: ../faq/index.rst:98
msgid "If you have doubts, feel free to ask your questions on mailing lists ;)"
msgstr "Če imate dvome, jih lahko postavite na poštnih seznamih ;)"

#: ../faq/index.rst:101
msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Prijavi hrošča"

#: ../faq/index.rst:103
msgid "Please, do not forget to:"
msgstr "Prosim, ne pozabite:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:105
msgid "tell us the Galette version you are using,"
msgstr "povejte nam, katero različico Galette uporabljate,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:106
msgid "be clear and concise,"
msgstr "bodi jasen in jedrnat,"

#: ../faq/index.rst:107
msgid "to provide all required information in order to reproduce the issue"
msgstr "zagotoviti vse potrebne informacije za reprodukcijo težave"

#: ../faq/index.rst:108
msgid "to provide related logs entries."
msgstr "zagotoviti vse potrebne informacije za težave pri reprodukciji."

#: ../faq/index.rst:111
msgid "Request For Enhancement"
msgstr "Zahteva za izboljšavo"

#: ../faq/index.rst:113
msgid ""
"Make sure to be precise as well on RFEs. Developers may not guess what you "
"have in mind, you have to explain them, event if this seems obvious to "
"you ;) Requested enhancements are tagged as \"Souhaits\" (wishes, in "
"french), and moved by developers when work begins most of the time."
msgstr ""
"Pri zahtevanih izboljšavah bodite natančni. Razvijalci morda ne bodo "
"uganili, kaj imate v mislih, zato jim morate razložiti, tudi če se vam to "
"zdi očitno ;) Zahtevane izboljšave so označene kot \"Souhaits\" (želje, v "
"francoščini) in jih razvijalci večinoma premaknejo, ko se delo začne."

#: ../faq/index.rst:116
msgid ""
"Once you made your wishes, you can `submit it to a vote <https://"
"vote.galette.eu/>`_, most wanted features may catch devs attention."
msgstr ""
"Ko enkrat izraziš svoje želje, jih lahko `oddaš na glasovanje <https://"
"vote.galette.eu/>`_, najbolj zaželene funkcije lahko pritegnejo pozornost "
"razvijalcev."

#: ../faq/index.rst:120
msgid "How to search in lists archives?"
msgstr "Kako iskati po arhivih seznamov?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:122
msgid ""
"Mailing lists are the main communication channel for Galette, from its "
"beginnings."
msgstr ""
"Poštni seznami so glavni komunikacijski kanal za Galette, že od samega "
"začetka."

#: ../faq/index.rst:124
msgid ""
"See `contact page <https://galette.eu/site/contact#mailing-lists>`_ for more "
"information."
msgstr ""
"Oglejte si `kontaktno stran <https://galette.eu/site/contact#mailing-"
"lists>`_ za več informacij."

#: ../faq/index.rst:126
msgid ""
"The most simple and reliable way to `search on past Galette related "
"discussion <https://www.mail-archive.com/search?l=all&q=galette&a=1>`_ is to "
"make a query on mail archive services."
msgstr ""
"Najpreprostejši in najzanesljivejši način za `iskanje preteklih razprav, "
"povezanih z Galette <https://www.mail-archive.com/search?"
"l=all&q=galette&a=1>`_ je poizvedba v storitvah arhiviranja pošte."

#: ../faq/index.rst:130
msgid "How to use same email address for several members?"
msgstr "Kako uporabiti isti e-poštni naslov za več članov?"

#: ../faq/index.rst:132
msgid "This is a very frequent question; many would love to do that..."
msgstr "To je zelo pogosto vprašanje; mnogi bi to radi storili ..."

#: ../faq/index.rst:134
msgid "**This is not possible.**"
msgstr "**To ni mogoče.**"

#: ../faq/index.rst:136
msgid ""
"Indeed, mail addresses must be unique in the database. It is a choice for "
"the project on which several features are built:"
msgstr ""
"Dejansko morajo biti poštni naslovi v bazi podatkov edinstveni. To je izbira "
"za projekt, na katerem je zgrajenih več funkcij:"

#: ../faq/index.rst:138
msgid "lost password (since... always or almost),"
msgstr "izgubljeno geslo (od ... vedno ali skoraj),"

#: ../faq/index.rst:139
msgid "login (since Galette 0.9),"
msgstr "prijava (od Galette 0.9),"

#: ../faq/index.rst:142
msgid ""
"Making them non unique is not a solution we want to rely on. This would be "
"complicated, and should be source of many bugs."
msgstr ""
"To, da jih naredimo ne-edinstvene, ni rešitev, na katero se želimo zanašati. "
"To bi bilo zapleteno in bi moralo biti vir številnih hroščev."

#: ../faq/index.rst:144
msgid ""
"However, it is possible in Galette to :ref:`link several members "
"<linkmembers>`. That way, some information such as email and postal "
"addresses will be retrieved from the parent member if missing."
msgstr ""
"Vendar pa je v Galette mogoče :ref:`povezati več članov <linkmembers>`. Na "
"ta način bodo nekatere informacije, kot so e-poštni in poštni naslovi, "
"pridobljene od nadrejenega člana, če manjkajo."

#: ../faq/index.rst:146
msgid ""
"This allows finally to use a unique email address for several members in "
"database; but they are not duplicates in database."
msgstr ""
"To končno omogoča uporabo edinstvenega e-poštnega naslova za več članov v "
"bazi podatkov; vendar ti niso podvojeni v bazi podatkov."
